                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "af0833b3-fc5a-3732-a5e9-b46dc31183bb",
                        "entry_id": "622d6090-1b80-309b-bb05-dc6d29586f8b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "устар., церк.-слав. : раз"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "только в выражении во сто крат"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a0b682aa-cfbd-46b9-9ee2-33b63b09dbd8",
                                "sense_id": "af0833b3-fc5a-3732-a5e9-b46dc31183bb",
                                "text": "Да, и штабс-капитан: в сердцах простых чувство красоты и величия природы сильнее, живее во сто крат, чем в нас, восторженных рассказчиках на словах и на бумаге."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "df4faf43-ef0d-469d-bfaa-97857e9d83a1",
                        "source_entry_id": "622d6090-1b80-309b-bb05-dc6d29586f8b",
                        "source_sense_id": "af0833b3-fc5a-3732-a5e9-b46dc31183bb",
                        "target_lang_word": "times",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "times",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7b29c830-0f00-3008-8669-9b1345423575",
                                        "entry_id": "48d5ee32-8d39-3886-af70-f1b6957d4312",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "plural of time"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "form-of",
                                            "plural"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "394162e2-d0a5-4acb-a0f2-6c9e4ba70c07",
                                                "sense_id": "7b29c830-0f00-3008-8669-9b1345423575",
                                                "text": "It's been ten times more difficult than expected."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8f4333c6-1d72-3a55-82f4-0796d0bdda45",
                                        "entry_id": "48d5ee32-8d39-3886-af70-f1b6957d4312",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The circumstances of a certain time."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "plural",
                                            "plural-only"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "370fb4df-c0f8-412b-9a48-d5dacf72271b",
                                                "sense_id": "8f4333c6-1d72-3a55-82f4-0796d0bdda45",
                                                "text": "Modern times are so very different from the past."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5595a235-5f8c-43c5-b846-6eecc6eb2bfc",
                                                "sense_id": "8f4333c6-1d72-3a55-82f4-0796d0bdda45",
                                                "text": "The city called Fan-yang in Eastern Han times can be identified with the present village of Ch’u-wang (Nei-huang County, Honan Province)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d8c32b71-b67b-4629-ad9a-7d3f4b21bf85",
                                                "sense_id": "8f4333c6-1d72-3a55-82f4-0796d0bdda45",
                                                "text": "From the ground, Colombo’s port does not look like much. Those entering it are greeted by wire fences, walls dating back to colonial times and security posts. For mariners leaving the port after lonely nights on the high seas, the delights of the B52 Night Club and Stallion Pub lie a stumble away."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "639e984a-b6b1-3cc2-9bd8-ecfaf07505ab",
                                        "entry_id": "48d5ee32-8d39-3886-af70-f1b6957d4312",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person's experiences or biography."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "plural",
                                            "plural-only"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e1c6ffd6-872f-46d5-86ae-dc170e13efd6",
                                                "sense_id": "639e984a-b6b1-3cc2-9bd8-ecfaf07505ab",
                                                "text": "The Life and Times of Rosie the Riveter."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "times",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "34a6ee32-27c8-319f-ba96-fd5df0861acd",
                                        "entry_id": "5ad84845-e968-3cf2-bdea-56e4a8b6ca5c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Multiplied by (see also 'ratio of comparison' sense at 'time')."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1ab7ba1e-ed06-4f3f-a3bb-d8088c3162f8",
                                                "sense_id": "34a6ee32-27c8-319f-ba96-fd5df0861acd",
                                                "text": "Four times five is/are twenty"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a616344b-994c-48a1-be22-d8280d40e5b4",
                                                "sense_id": "34a6ee32-27c8-319f-ba96-fd5df0861acd",
                                                "text": "One times one is one."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "times",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9fd65579-3038-3d4b-841a-665dbda20714",
                                        "entry_id": "26417519-86cc-3ca8-9bb1-c510049a1393",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "third-person singular simple present indicative of time"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "form-of",
                                            "indicative",
                                            "present",
                                            "singular",
                                            "third-person"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "times",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "75e1d7ba-21f5-374b-9e9f-8fce7a5d9c0a",
                                        "entry_id": "dc1dd82b-c95d-310a-ac80-5baf920599db",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To multiply."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "07b62dbe-5d38-4f37-94b6-2b38d75796bd",
                                                "sense_id": "75e1d7ba-21f5-374b-9e9f-8fce7a5d9c0a",
                                                "text": "I've taken the calories and the amount of food . . . and it's 410 calories per portion timesed by 6 portions which ^([sic]) the answer was 2460 calories..."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b49398ef-8d53-4563-bc08-61c1b727f9af",
                                                "sense_id": "75e1d7ba-21f5-374b-9e9f-8fce7a5d9c0a",
                                                "text": "A student as junior as Year 4 informed me that he made a forward estimate of cheeses in 100 trials by 'timesing both numbers by 10' […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4af48262-ce14-4f8d-92db-094f1c4e0fa3",
                                                "sense_id": "75e1d7ba-21f5-374b-9e9f-8fce7a5d9c0a",
                                                "text": "Alex: Yeah - if you're timesing that distance there by this height, it will disappear."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "51ddf99f-5225-46d2-9255-a055a84ddc07",
                                                "sense_id": "75e1d7ba-21f5-374b-9e9f-8fce7a5d9c0a",
                                                "text": "[…] when the denominator was timesed by three, the same had to be done to the numerator; and so on."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f46f0e01-43c9-4d39-bfca-ab6b6e4a6f50",
                                                "sense_id": "75e1d7ba-21f5-374b-9e9f-8fce7a5d9c0a",
                                                "text": "Well, take that feeling, and times it by a thousand and you can probably understand the sheer disgust aimed at me by my fellow diners at Palm Vaults."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
